{"type":"delta","text":"This is the right question to be asking, and the sequencing matters more than "}
{"type":"delta","text":"the total envelope. Let me work through it directly. Start with what to kill or "}
{"type":"delta","text":"restructure immediately, before committing another dollar. The CDP Migration "}
{"type":"delta","text":"Phase 2 needs to be scoped down now. \"Over-scoped\" migrations almost always mean "}
{"type":"delta","text":"the team chased a platform-complete vision when a capability-complete view would "}
{"type":"delta","text":"have served the roadmap better. If the SAP ERP decision is genuinely open, any "}
{"type":"delta","text":"CDP architecture that assumes a stable data foundation is premature — you risk "}
{"type":"delta","text":"building integration work twice. I'd restructure this to a Phase 2a that "}
{"type":"delta","text":"delivers only the identity resolution and behavioral segmentation capabilities "}
{"type":"delta","text":"you need for ecom personalization in the next 12 months, and park everything "}
{"type":"delta","text":"that depends on a clean ERP data layer until SAP clarifies. This is a "}
{"type":"delta","text":"restructure, not a kill — the destination is right, the scope is wrong. "}
{"type":"delta","text":"Einstein: this one frustrates me because the asset is paid for and sitting idle. "}
{"type":"delta","text":"Your Salesforce renewal is 139 days out with the CMO already asking for Einstein "}
{"type":"delta","text":"activation — that's actually leverage, not a problem. But before you activate, "}
{"type":"delta","text":"you need to answer one question: what does Einstein feed? If your Commerce Cloud "}
{"type":"delta","text":"customer data isn't clean and the CDP is mid-migration, activating Einstein into "}
{"type":"delta","text":"a fragmented data state will produce mediocre personalization that gets blamed "}
{"type":"delta","text":"on the AI, not the data."}
{"type":"followups","followups":["You said Einstein activation depends on clean Commerce Cloud customer data — given our current ecom mix gap of 18.5% vs 24% peer median, what's the minimum viable data quality threshold we need before Einstein turns on, and how do we measure we've hit it without waiting for the full Commerce Cloud replatform to complete?","On the Commerce Cloud Optimization replatform itself — is that the accelerate or the wait? If we restructure CDP Phase 2a and hold Einstein, does the replatform timeline change, and what specific ecom mix lift can we actually expect from it independent of personalization?","The SAP ERP decision is pending — what's the decision timeline, and what's our contingency spend plan for the $30M if SAP clarifies in 6 months vs 18 months? Do we front-load the Phase 2a CDP work now, or does sequencing change based on SAP decision velocity?"]}
{"type":"done"}

