{"type":"delta","text":"Yes. Replatform.\n"}
{"type":"delta","text":"Here's my reasoning in brief: Commerce Cloud tends to become a strategic anchor "}
{"type":"delta","text":"when the cost and rigidity of staying exceeds the disruption cost of moving. For "}
{"type":"delta","text":"most mid-to-large multi-banner retailers at this stage of the AI curve, that "}
{"type":"delta","text":"crossover has already happened — the platform's data model limits real-time "}
{"type":"delta","text":"personalization, the API surface constrains the AI integrations that matter most "}
{"type":"delta","text":"(recommendations, search, dynamic merchandising), and Salesforce's licensing "}
{"type":"delta","text":"trajectory is unfavorable.\n"}
{"type":"delta","text":"That said — I'm reasoning from pattern, not from your specific contract terms, "}
{"type":"delta","text":"integration count, or migration cost estimate. Before you pull the trigger, the "}
{"type":"delta","text":"number that actually matters is loaded migration cost versus 36-month total cost "}
{"type":"delta","text":"of ownership on the current platform. If that math hasn't been done with real "}
{"type":"delta","text":"numbers, do it first, because the decision is easy to get right directionally "}
{"type":"delta","text":"and wrong financially.\n"}
{"type":"delta","text":"If you want to shape this as an actual Move with the business case and failure "}
{"type":"delta","text":"modes built in, Nexus can take it from here with what we've discussed."}
{"type":"followups","followups":["What's our realistic migration timeline and which Commerce Cloud workloads should we move first to de-risk the cutover?","Who are the leading replacement platforms for our use case — Shopify Plus, custom build, best-of-breed composable stack — and what's the ballpark TCO difference?","What's our actual loaded migration cost estimate today, and has finance pressure-tested the 36-month TCO comparison against staying on Salesforce with optimization?"]}
{"type":"done"}

