{"type":"delta","text":"That's not something I have access to — McKinsey deliverables aren't in your "}
{"type":"delta","text":"connected enterprise data, so I can't pull from a specific benchmark report.\n"}
{"type":"delta","text":"What I can do: if you share the headline numbers or the peer set they used, I "}
{"type":"delta","text":"can pressure-test the methodology and tell you whether the comparisons are "}
{"type":"delta","text":"actually apples-to-apples for Apex's banner structure. Benchmark reports in "}
{"type":"delta","text":"retail ecom tend to conflate pure-play and omnichannel margins in ways that make "}
{"type":"delta","text":"the peer set look worse than it should — worth checking before you anchor "}
{"type":"delta","text":"strategy to the numbers.\n"}
{"type":"delta","text":"Alternatively, if the underlying question is where Apex's ecom margins actually "}
{"type":"delta","text":"stand relative to where they should be, and what AI bets move that needle, "}
{"type":"delta","text":"that's a conversation I can have directly. What are you trying to decide?"}
